# Copy to .env (git-ignored). One .env per client repo.
#
# Agents never see this file. A task that needs a secret lists its name under
# `secrets:` in its task file, and bin/factory passes only those values to that
# task's agent. Values here are read as NAME=value, one per line.
#
# Example, for a task with `secrets: [PAYROLL_SANDBOX_API_KEY]`:
# PAYROLL_SANDBOX_API_KEY=
